    {
      "id": 5,
      "title": "Fan-out size per parent change",
      "description": "How many documents a single parent change forced. This is a summary, not a sampled gauge, so it records the event whatever the scrape interval \u2014 unlike the backlog panel, where a burst that drains in a second can fall between two scrapes and never appear.",
