    {
      "id": 6,
      "title": "Outbox backlog",
      "description": "Where a fan-out lands. The write stays fast; this absorbs the burst. Note that a small fan-out can drain between scrapes and leave no trace here \u2014 trust the fan-out summary for the event, and this for sustained pressure.",
